{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/053-gan-mao/quwanli-quanshi","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/053-gan-mao/quwanli-quanshi/data.json","title":"詩經詮釋 · 干旄 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 鄘風 · 干旄 · 汇集《詩經詮釋》关于《干旄》的 1 条注释，含 1 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"053-gan-mao","materialId":"quwanli-quanshi"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/053-gan-mao/quwanli-quanshi","poem":{"id":"053-gan-mao","title":"干旄","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"yongfeng","path":["風","鄘風","干旄"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"孑孑干旄","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-002","text":"在浚之郊","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-003","text":"素絲紕之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-004","text":"良馬四之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-005","text":"彼姝者子","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-006","text":"何以畀之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-007","text":"孑孑干旟","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-008","text":"在浚之都","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-009","text":"素絲組之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-010","text":"良馬五之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-011","text":"彼姝者子","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-012","text":"何以予之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-013","text":"孑孑干旌","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-014","text":"在浚之城","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-015","text":"素絲祝之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-016","text":"良馬六之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-017","text":"彼姝者子","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-018","text":"何以告之","isActive":true}]},"material":{"id":"quwanli-quanshi","title":"詩經詮釋","authors":["屈萬里"],"contributorLine":"现代 · 屈萬里","era":"现代","publicationYear":1983,"carrier":"PDF"},"stats":{"annotationCount":1,"glossCount":1},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":1,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"孑孑干旄，在浚之郊。素絲紕之，良馬四之。彼姝者子，何以畀之？孑孑干旟，在浚之都。素絲組之，良馬五之。彼姝者子，何以予之？孑孑干旌，在浚之城。素絲祝之，良馬六之。彼姝者子，何以告之？","targetNotes":"《注释》②至⑭撮要。","sourceLabel":"第 64 页","sourceNotes":"书页 64《注释》②至⑭。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":"注释","text":"屈万里依次释“干”为旗杆、“旄”为旄牛尾，“浚”为卫邑，“紕”为在旗上以白丝镶边；又释“姝”为美貌而通指所见之人，“畀”为予。次章释“旟”为画鸟隼之旗，“都”为下邑，“組”为联缀旗饰；末章释“旌”为析羽注旄的旗，“祝”为属、谓编连其缕，并指出“五之、六之”都见车马礼数转益其盛。","notes":null}]}]}}}
